-// Macros and functions for implementing parameterized tests
-// in Google C++ Testing and Mocking Framework (Google Test)
-
-// IWYU pragma: private, include "gtest/gtest.h"
-// IWYU pragma: friend gtest/.*
-// IWYU pragma: friend gmock/.*
